{"series":{"id":"nirvana-storm-rider","slug":"nirvana-storm-rider","title":"Nirvana Storm Rider","image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2025-06/1000280201-pica.png?itok=jWJNSNBt","synopsis":"Los artistas marciales Bu Jingyun y Nie Feng se transformaron en estados cuánticos para combatir una catástrofe inminente y desaparecieron. Tres mil años después, un meteorito impactó la Tierra, dejándola en un páramo. Atrapados bajo tierra, los humanos descubrieron la \"Energía Pulso\", un superpoder en su interior. Bu Tianyun despertó accidentalmente a Bu Jingyun y descubrió su propio potencial de \"Energía Pulso\". Junto con Nie Zifeng, el heredero de Nie Feng, emprendieron un viaje para convertirse en \"Guerreros Pulso\" y proteger su mundo.","status":"En Emisión","year":2024,"genres":[],"type":"donghua","src":"donghualife","sourceUrls":["https://donghualife.com/series/nirvana-storm-rider"],"updatedAt":"2026-09-19T16:49:03.140Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"nirvana-storm-rider-t1","slug":"nirvana-storm-rider-t1","seriesId":"nirvana-storm-rider","number":1,"image":"https://donghualife.com/sites/default/files/styles/node_series/public/2025-06/1000280201-pica.png?itok=jWJNSNBt","updatedAt":"2026-09-19T16:49:03.140Z","episodeCount":30}],"episodes":[{"id":"nirvana-storm-rider-t1-e30","slug":"nirvana-storm-rider-t1-e30","title":"nirvana-storm-rider-1-episodio-x30","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/episode/nirvana-storm-rider-1-episodio-x30","servers":[{"name":"geo.dailymotion.com","url":"https://geo.dailymotion.com/player.html?video=krVeuzDWHlD4nFCJD3e","embed":true}],"seriesId":"nirvana-storm-rider","seasonId":"nirvana-storm-rider-t1","number":30,"updatedAt":"2026-09-19T16:56:07.560Z"},{"id":"nirvana-storm-rider-t1-e29","slug":"nirvana-storm-rider-t1-e29","title":"nirvana-storm-rider-1-episodio-x29","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/episode/nirvana-storm-rider-1-episodio-x29","servers":[{"name":"geo.dailymotion.com","url":"https://geo.dailymoti